1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,378
If your giant
predator eats

2
00:00:01,398 --> 00:00:02,779
everything,
why hasn't

3
00:00:02,799 --> 00:00:04,593
everything gone
extinct?

4
00:00:04,613 --> 00:00:05,459
Let's test it.

5
00:00:05,479 --> 00:00:06,534
This is the Grimmaw.

6
00:00:06,554 --> 00:00:08,233
It eats anything
that moves.

7
00:00:08,253 --> 00:00:09,250
Press run.

8
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:11,213
Year one:
mossbacks everywhere.

9
00:00:11,233 --> 00:00:12,400
Year three:
thinning.

10
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,858
Year five:
gone.

11
00:00:13,878 --> 00:00:15,144
With nothing left to
hunt,

12
00:00:15,164 --> 00:00:16,679
the Grimmaw starves
too.

13
00:00:16,699 --> 00:00:18,525
A monster that eats
everything doesn't

14
00:00:18,545 --> 00:00:19,550
rule your world.

15
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:20,934
It ends it.

16
00:00:20,954 --> 00:00:22,929
Real predators live
inside limits.

17
00:00:22,949 --> 00:00:24,004
Four are easy.

18
00:00:24,024 --> 00:00:25,618
The fifth is the
twist.

19
00:00:25,638 --> 00:00:26,736
One:
prey that breeds

20
00:00:26,756 --> 00:00:27,963
faster than it's
eaten.

21
00:00:27,983 --> 00:00:29,176
Two:
territory.

22
00:00:29,196 --> 00:00:30,949
One Grimmaw needs a
whole valley.

23
00:00:30,969 --> 00:00:32,111
Three:
energy.

24
00:00:32,131 --> 00:00:33,661
A body this big
hunts rarely and

25
00:00:33,681 --> 00:00:34,675
sleeps a lot.

26
00:00:34,695 --> 00:00:36,062
Four:
slow breeding.

27
00:00:36,082 --> 00:00:38,051
One cub every few
winters.

28
00:00:38,071 --> 00:00:39,063
Run it again.

29
00:00:39,083 --> 00:00:40,713
Now the numbers rise
and fall,

30
00:00:40,733 --> 00:00:42,420
but nothing vanishes.

31
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,145
Rule five?

32
00:00:43,165 --> 00:00:44,433
Delete the monster.

33
00:00:44,453 --> 00:00:46,134
The mossbacks boom,
strip the meadow

34
00:00:46,154 --> 00:00:47,592
bare,
then starve.

35
00:00:47,612 --> 00:00:49,242
Rule five is its job.

36
00:00:49,262 --> 00:00:51,439
The Grimmaw holds
the island together.

37
00:00:51,459 --> 00:00:52,836
Don't design a
monster.

38
00:00:52,856 --> 00:00:54,722
Design its place in
the world.

39
00:00:54,742 --> 00:00:56,284
Share this with
someone designing

40
00:00:56,304 --> 00:00:58,097
fantasy monsters.
